{"sourceUrl":"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/noticezs/1419683.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:04:00.299345+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/noticezs/1419683.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span><span>我院现</span></span></span><span><span><span>组织</span></span></span><span><span><span>开展</span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名工作</span></span></span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>第二批</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>请符合申请条件的申请人（包括本校应届生）按以下通知内容报名：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（一）中华人民共和国公民</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（三）在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（四）学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（五）诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（六）身体健康状况符合国家和中山大学规定的体检要求</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（七）入学前须本科毕业并获得学士学位</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（八）</span></span></span><span><span><span>其余申请条件要符合中山大学推荐免试研究生招生章程及接收办法中的要求。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>二、招生专业</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>招收专业</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>方向</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>083100生物医学工程</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>（学术学位）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>01生物医学材料</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>02生物医学传感</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>03医疗仪器</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>085409生物医学工程</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>69不分方向</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>086001生物技术与工程</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>69不分方向</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div> </div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span>说明：实际招生专业以学校最终公布的</span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>年研究生招生专业目录为准。</span></span></span><span><span><span>各专业实际接收推免生人数将根据招生计划、生源情况等进行调整，以实际录取为准。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>三、申请材料</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1.《中山大学生物医学工程学院接收202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表》原件</span><span>1份；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2.一篇300-500字左右的科研兴趣自述；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.本科阶段成绩单及同年级总成绩排名1份（由教务部门或院系盖章）；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>4.身份证、学生证复印件各1份；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>5.四六级证书、或其他英语水平证明材料；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>6.其他：各类获奖证书、发表论文、专利证书等材料。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>以上材料请于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日前扫描，并制成一个</span><span>PDF文件（文件命名为拟报考学科方向-姓名-毕业学校-手机号码-</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>第二批</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>预推免），材料须已填写并签名或盖章，并按以上</span><span>1-6顺序依次排列，确保无误后在报名网页作为“申请材料”上传提交。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>申请</span></span></span><span><span><span>者</span></span></span><span><span><span>须承诺所提供信息、材料及申请身份的真实性。一经查证为不属实或不符合我校招生要求的，我校将取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>申请</span></span></span><span><span><span>者</span></span></span><span><span><span>若存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>四、申请流程</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>网上报名：进行报名的同</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学于</span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>前登陆下面网址进行网上报名，注意所有电子版申请材料信息必须与网报信息完全一致，否则将影响报名。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>具体报名网址：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>五、</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>初审与考核</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>学院将根据报名情况进行初步筛选，分批确定面试名单，并于学院官网公布。届时请同学们留意，具体时间安排将另行通知。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>1.</span><span>考核内容：重点考查考生的知识结构、实践能力、综合分析和解决实际问题的能力、创新能力、写作水平以及道德品质和心理素质。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2.</span><span>考核时间：每位考生的考核时间（含外语应用能力面试）不少于</span><span>20</span><span>分钟。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>3.</span><span>考核办法</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）以面试为主，面试小组对参加面试的考生逐个进行考核。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）考核采取由考核教师提问，考生当场回答的方式进行。必要时，考核教师可就相关问题进一步提问。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>4.</span><span>考核评分</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>每位考生面试结束后，由考核教师现场独立为考生评分。在评分前可召开复试小组会议，研究对考生的考核评价意见。考核教师各自评分的算术平均值为该考生的最终考核分数。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>5.面试成绩</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>按照总成绩从高分到低分依次确定推免拟录取名单。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）面试成绩满分为</span><span>100</span><span>分，包括：外语应用能力、专业素质、综合能力等。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）直博生及硕士生分别排序，面试均依照同样的程序进行。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）面试不及格者不予录取，及格者择优录取。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>六</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>、其他</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>1.</span><span>说明</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>此通知为预报名通知，具体要求以教育部及中山大学</span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生接收工作相关</span></span></span><span><span><span>、接收办法</span></span></span><span><span><span>通知为准。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>推免生的报名及录取均通过教育部</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址</span></span></span><span><span>: https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/<span>）进行</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span>所有推免生（含</span><span>“</span><span>免试硕士生</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>直博生</span><span>”</span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span><span>均</span></span></span><span><span><span>需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成资格审查、填报志愿、</span></span></span><span><span><span>缴纳报名费</span></span></span><span><span><span>、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>推免复审及体检要求请留意学校及院系后续发布的推免接收办法及相关通知。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span><span>联系方式</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>联系人：中山大学生物医学工程学院董老师</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>地址：深圳市光明区中山大学医学园</span><span>2</span><span>栋</span><span>205</span><span>办公室</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>电话：</span><span>0755-23260140</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span><span>bmeyjs</span></span></span><span><span><span>@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span>附件：中山大学生物医学工程学院接收</span><span>2026</span><span>年推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表</span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span>生物医学工程</span></span></span><span><span><span>学院</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p>\n<br/>\n<p> 相关附件:<br/>\n\n1、<a href=\"https://bme.sysu.edu.cn/docs/2025-09/20250904165851718089.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"中山大学生物医学工程学院接收2026年推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表.docx\">中山大学生物医学工程学院接收2026年推荐免试生攻读研究生申请表</a><br/>\n</p>\n</div>","textSha256":"9034a594718a08cbdf1c2df0f9387405169ebfaeb5d418a8c981a8325a42fe10","textLength":1895,"sourceSha256":"a7a73e9c15eaf73356c0b428188a9665cda8e02f10ba1631dfc6dff91b19e6b1","selector":".cont","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2a13dba716b8f6bd6eca","title":"2025年中山大学生物医学工程学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名通知 （第二批）","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:04:00.299345+00:00"}
